{"Event listener only executes when ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ is enabled, but V2-only deployments enable ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ_V2 and leave the legacy flag false, so role/client/group removals no longer disable permissions and stale configs remain; should gate on the V2 feature as well (or both) so cleanup still runs": 0.9216081500053406, "resourceStore.findByName uses server.getId() as owner while AdminPermissionsSchema creates client resources owned by resourceServer.getClientId(), so per-client resource is never found and wrongly falls back to all-clients; should look up by server.getClientId() so permission actually resolves": 0.7963796854019165}